{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是爸爸妈妈领养的孩子，上面有两个哥哥现在已经成家了。我现在就读高中，前段时间因为抑郁症把家里人折腾的不轻.那段时间最常听到的话就是“看着你这样我心里也好苦”“不知道你为什么会有这样的想法，明明以前是一个多开朗的小孩”听到这些我有点迷茫。以前真的开朗嘛？我不知道。

今天在餐桌上看见爸爸妈妈疲劳的身体，突然感想，没有我他们是不是就会轻松很多？家里并不富裕但也不是贫困，爸爸会出外面上班（应该算进厂吧），妈妈时不时去卖菜。有时候我会问妈妈，这样供我读书是不是很辛苦？爸爸听了就说“只要我和你妈妈没病没灾供你读书就没有问题”我有点恐慌。我最常听到的就是妈妈告诉我要节约，体谅爸爸这么大年纪（近六十了）挣钱不容易.我经常会想，我对于这个家庭算不算负担？如果没有我，爸爸妈妈现在应该在含饴弄孙吧？不需要这么勤劳的挣钱，最多也就搞点吃的的钱。

爸爸妈妈想我考上大学以后结婚生子最好在本地，可是我并没有这些想法，我感觉有点累了。我不太明白我活着的意义了，这两天的身体很疲惫，很贪睡。但也是我睡得最安稳的时候，睡着了多好啊，一片虚无。如果我就这么去了，是不是会觉得我很自私？觉得我的爸爸妈妈就算辛苦也供了我十几年书，就这么撒手人寰一定也对不起他们？那我该怎么做呢？应该打鸡血去奋斗吗？搏一搏单车变摩托？可是我很累啊，这已经不是第一次挣扎了。就这样活下去那我是在为谁活呢？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"子女听到父母喊辛苦，最容易犯的错误就是认为这是一种抱怨。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"父母的辛苦其实是一种原料，是可以通过结出果实而转化为幸福的东西。ta们要的根本不是“解除辛苦”，而是“辛苦结出果实”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"子女只要持续成长着，父母的辛苦本身反而成为一种享受，会带来快感，甚至形成瘾症依赖。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"父亲喜欢辛苦一天给女儿买一串糖葫芦，看女儿吃得笑哈哈。让他重新选择，他会毫不犹豫的选择再辛苦一天再买一串糖葫芦，而不会选“女儿不吃糖葫芦，自己也不用累”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要子女结出果实，父母的辛苦是一种享受，而不是折磨。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以父母抱怨的从来就不是辛苦本身，而是子女卡住了后半段工序，不愿意把ta们所提供的辛苦的原料酿造成幸福和欣慰。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是所谓的“不珍惜”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，客观上讲，子女打出“我消失，这样你们就不用辛苦了”这张牌，不但不是在“免除父母的辛苦”，反而是在惩罚和折磨父母，尝试剥夺父母的基本福利和人生价值。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只是用“免除辛苦”包装了一层，看上去似乎很宽大罢了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为父母已经辛苦了十几年了，过往的辛苦已成既成事实，大量的原料囤积在你的仓库里等着酿成好酒。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你因为不想承担酿造责任，决定一把火把这货仓烧了，宣布“你们应该高兴，因为你们以后不需要送更多的原料来了，可以放假了”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这显然是说不通的，根本就不会造成父母的轻松快乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而最可叹的是，你是真的不懂吗？真的不知道这样并不是仁慈、宽免，而是折磨和惩罚吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你是知道的，你是故意要惩罚ta们——惩罚ta们给你堆了这么满仓的原料，让你背上了巨大的酿造工作量。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而你却根本不会酿酒。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你没法把这些原料酿成酒，这些堆到屋顶的储备只让你觉得痛苦和抑郁。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们继续往里堆货，你的痛苦和抑郁就会更甚。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这才是你要用这个看似高尚、仁慈的逻辑去实际惩罚ta们的原因。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个问题的症结无疑是在酿酒问题上。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而在这个问题上你有重大的误解。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你误以为你必须把这些原料酿成顶级好酒才能交差、因为很显然父母在一车车往仓库里堆货的时候是这么期盼的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而且ta们尝了早期样品后抱怨你的成品味道不好，似乎暗示着ta们就是要那个顶级佳酿的结果。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但这其实是一个误解。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"ta们真正的底线是只要酿出点东西就行。不需要是什么十大名酒，甚至不是酒都可以。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你酿出一瓶醋，都行。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"只要你不拿去倒掉、烧掉，就算拿一整仓原料只酿成了一瓶醋，都行。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个“都行”是自然法核准的，你的父母私心可能一开始不满、“失望”，但","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"自然法至高无上","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"，容不得ta们不受，ta们最后总会放下自己的奢望、执念，学会知足常乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你放心，人类就是这样被塑造出来的，喊价总是能喊多高喊多高，但是实际的心理底价就是“没酒，醋也行”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要ta们一开始别把价喊那么高没用，ta们总要试一试，万一你真的能以这个价格成交呢？难道试都不试？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"但你放心，实际上你就算只交出一瓶醋，ta们最后纠结完了，最后还是会回到“有瓶醋也可以了”的心态立场上去，而且会最终走向知足常乐。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你只是交易经验少，不懂这其中的道道，所以一听甲方的诈唬就压力过大了罢了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这不是在告诉你只需要交瓶醋就完事了，而是在告诉你，你还是要能酿出多好的酒就尽量尝试，只是你要把“拿不到博览会金奖就交不了差”的恐惧丢掉。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你努力完只要有哪怕一瓶醋交、你都过关了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你过关的概率其实很高，根本就不难。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以根本也不需要走这个所谓的“我一把火烧了，你们也不用辛苦了”的路线。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"放心大胆的酿你的酒去，唯一的最大风险就是你老人家三天上房两天揭瓦纯瞎胡闹，实际上最常规的工序就保证了最后连瓶醋都没有的概率极低，根本没什么可担心的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最后你一开坛，常常酸掉眉毛——没事，直接命名为“紫琼贡酒”，弄个好点的酒标，告诉ta们限量珍藏、绝版供应，富含负离子抗氧化成分。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"保证二老巴巴的捧回去，逢年过节才拿出来喝一点高兴高兴。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"妥得很。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你要是不信，你直接把这篇东西拿去给父母看，你看ta们点不点头。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这就是阳谋。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"世界上最好交的货，就是父母找子女订的货，真是寄块砖头都会给你好评的那种买家。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这你要都能搞砸，简直商业奇迹。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}
